OL,3,GNEWSAAutistic DJ befriended at festival
OL,4,Agiven 'dream' set
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn autistic man whose story about being
OL,7,Fbefriended by strangers when he
OL,8,Fattended his first-ever festival alone
OL,9,Fwent viral has been invited to play a
OL,10,FDJ set next year.
OL,12,FAdam James, 23, from High Wycombe in
OL,13,FBuckinghamshire, "realised his dream"
OL,14,Fafter he made friends with a group of
OL,15,Ffestival-goers who invited him to camp
OL,16,Fwith them at Boomtown Fair in
OL,17,FHampshire.
OL,19,FThe lifelong music fan and aspiring
OL,20,Fdrum and bass DJ has now been offered a
OL,21,Fset at the festival in 2027.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
