OL,3,GNEWSAAutistic DJ befriended at festival
OL,4,Agiven 'dream' set
OL,5,
OL,6,FAdam's dad, Andy, whose social media
OL,7,Fpost thanking the "lads from Bristol"
OL,8,Fwho took Adam under their wing has been
OL,9,Fseen by millions, said he had seen his
OL,10,F"son's dreams come true".
